# blog.rduffy.uk is retired — canonical site is rduffy.uk/writing (VW-1085).
# Slugs are identical across both sites, so /posts/<slug> maps 1:1 to /writing/<slug>.
# Cloudflare Pages: redirects are always followed even when a static asset matches the path.
# Order matters — first match wins, so the specific /posts/* rule precedes the catch-all.
/posts/*    https://rduffy.uk/writing/:splat    301
/*          https://rduffy.uk/                   301
